WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.860
My desk is made of wood.

2
00:00:13.861 --> 00:00:16.867
The wood is smooth.

3
00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:20.377
My scissors are made of steel.

4
00:00:20.378 --> 00:00:24.275
The steel is shiny.

5
00:00:24.276 --> 00:00:27.799
My window is made of glass.

6
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.680
The glass is clear.

7
00:00:31.681 --> 00:00:34.818
My T-shirt is made of cotton.

8
00:00:34.819 --> 00:00:38.412
The cotton is soft.

9
00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:41.909
My house is made of bricks.

10
00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.916
The brick is heavy.

11
00:00:45.918 --> 00:00:49.325
My sweater is made of wool.

12
00:00:49.326 --> 00:00:52.764
The wool is warm.

13
00:00:52.765 --> 00:00:56.185
My kite is made of paper.

14
00:00:56.186 --> 00:00:59.471
The paper is light.

15
00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:03.180
My dog's coat is made of fur.

16
00:01:03.181 --> 00:01:07.939
The fur is fuzzy.

17
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:14.652
I like his fuzzy fur!
